 "title": "Agriculture: Cropping Patterns and Irrigation",
 "emoji": "🌾",
 "cards": [
  {
   "tag": "Why this matters",
   "h": "Farming employs nearly half of India",
   "b": "<p>Agriculture and allied sectors employ about 46% of workers but give about 18% of GVA (as of recent years). So farm policy is a big political economy issue. UPSC mixes geography (where, why) with policy (MSP, irrigation, diversification).</p>"
  },
  {
   "tag": "Core idea",
   "h": "Farming types and seasons",
   "b": "<svg class=\"d\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 128\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"6\" width=\"55\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f1e4c6\" stroke=\"#a8792a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"37.5\" y=\"23\" fill=\"#7d5a1c\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Season</text><rect x=\"65\" y=\"6\" width=\"95\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f1e4c6\" stroke=\"#a8792a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"112.5\" y=\"23\" fill=\"#7d5a1c\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Sown-Harvest</text><rect x=\"160\" y=\"6\" width=\"150\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f1e4c6\" stroke=\"#a8792a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"235.0\" y=\"23\" fill=\"#7d5a1c\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Main crops</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"32\" width=\"55\" height=\"30\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#f3f1ec\" stroke=\"#c9c2b6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"37.5\" y=\"51\" fill=\"#1d2433\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Kharif</text><rect x=\"65\" y=\"32\" width=\"95\" height=\"30\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#f3f1ec\" stroke=\"#c9c2b6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"112.5\" y=\"51\" fill=\"#1d2433\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Jun-Jul to Sep-Oct</text><rect x=\"160\" y=\"32\" width=\"150\" height=\"30\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#f3f1ec\" stroke=\"#c9c2b6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"235.0\" y=\"51\" fill=\"#1d2433\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Rice, maize, cotton, jowar, bajra, soyabean</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"62\" width=\"55\" height=\"30\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#f3f1ec\" stroke=\"#c9c2b6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"37.5\" y=\"81\" fill=\"#1d2433\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Rabi</text><rect x=\"65\" y=\"62\" width=\"95\" height=\"30\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#f3f1ec\" stroke=\"#c9c2b6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"112.5\" y=\"81\" fill=\"#1d2433\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Oct-Dec to Mar-Apr</text><rect x=\"160\" y=\"62\" width=\"150\" height=\"30\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#f3f1ec\" stroke=\"#c9c2b6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"235.0\" y=\"81\" fill=\"#1d2433\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Wheat, barley, gram, mustard</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"92\" width=\"55\" height=\"30\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#f3f1ec\" stroke=\"#c9c2b6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"37.5\" y=\"111\" fill=\"#1d2433\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Zaid</text><rect x=\"65\" y=\"92\" width=\"95\" height=\"30\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#f3f1ec\" stroke=\"#c9c2b6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"112.5\" y=\"111\" fill=\"#1d2433\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Mar to Jun</text><rect x=\"160\" y=\"92\" width=\"150\" height=\"30\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#f3f1ec\" stroke=\"#c9c2b6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"235.0\" y=\"111\" fill=\"#1d2433\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Watermelon, cucumber, fodder</text></svg><p>Types: <b>subsistence</b>, <b>commercial</b>, <b>plantation</b> (tea, coffee, rubber), <b>shifting</b> (jhum in the Northeast), <b>dry farming</b> in under 75 cm rain regions, and <b>intensive</b> farming in the plains.</p>"
  },
  {
